<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:18:22Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>為何特朗普新一輪關稅的威脅不如以往？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4rw1r4p29o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:18:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T04:22:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4rw1r4p29o/trad--36d7ef76aebc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4rw1r4p29o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">面對特朗普首輪關稅攻勢，世界各國已調整貿易流向，繞過美國的關稅壁壘。如今，各國更將目光投向特朗普卸任後的時代。</summary></entry><entry><title>台中市選戰：江啟臣對決何欣純，盧秀燕問鼎總統前哨戰</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx053e8yr348o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:18:07Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T05:47:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx053e8yr348o/trad--5104151cb8ef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx053e8yr348o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣選舉傳統中，素有「決戰中台灣」一稱。江啟臣若當選，盧路線將得到選民加持，其在國民黨內的聲望也有望進一步升高。</summary></entry><entry><title>押注英偉達發展AI，亞洲在黃仁勳復職後前景如何？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62p0n4er0wo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:18:10Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T07:40:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62p0n4er0wo/trad--544c1e02b358.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62p0n4er0wo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳戲劇性地重返英偉達執行長職位，引發亞洲股市劇烈波動，也暴露出區內經濟體高度依賴AI產業及英偉達所帶來的風險。</summary></entry><entry><title>失去伊朗石油供應，中國小型煉油廠如何應對？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qj5y7lwrn9o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:18:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T03:35:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qj5y7lwrn9o/trad--e58497657c17.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qj5y7lwrn9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國對伊朗實施海上封鎖，迫使長期依賴廉價伊朗石油的中國獨立煉油廠轉向伊拉克等產油國，面臨成本上升和經營虧損的壓力。即使封鎖解除，伊朗能否重新贏得這些中國買家，仍取決於油價及美國的制裁政策。</summary></entry><entry><title>白紙運動四年之後，上海青年公共空間去哪兒了？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe851kg1kj1o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T00:29:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe851kg1kj1o/trad--7ba6a5acc106.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe851kg1kj1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白紙運動四年後，BBC中文對話多位上海酒吧、咖啡店老闆和昔日常客、白紙運動親歷者，在他們眼裡，青年空間是如何在四年裡逐漸消失的。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣「九合一」選舉：六都市長候選人簡介</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwlymzm5mnxyo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T16:04:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwlymzm5mnxyo/trad--b8c48542c832.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwlymzm5mnxyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這場選舉將影響藍綠政治版圖，六都選情備受關注，包括台北、新北、桃園、台中、台南、高雄，BBC中文整理各地候選人的簡介。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:18:16Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T04:47:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣時隔一年再「核電公投」：這次投什麼？通過門檻為何？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0rdle4l1lvo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:18:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T07:56:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0rdle4l1lvo/trad--85eda76e05fa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0rdle4l1lvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「廢除非核家園」公投案在今年11月28日的九合一選舉同日投票。這是台灣相隔短短一年後再有公投，也是當地近8年來，第4度舉行關於核電公投。BBC中文整理此次公投的背景和重點。</summary></entry><entry><title>九合一選前反轉：沈伯洋破天荒取消台北「選前之夜」，如何影響選情？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwz0kymdzdd8o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T13:41:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwz0kymdzdd8o/trad--31c56c9c47c7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwz0kymdzdd8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這是台北市自1994年恢復市長直選以來，首次有民進黨參選人不舉辦選前之夜。有政治學者向BBC中文分析，沈伯洋取消活動可為交通爭議「止血」，但同時窒礙了綠營凝聚聲勢。</summary></entry><entry><title>宏福苑大火一周年：居民受壓、媒體噤聲，為何悼念變得小心翼翼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw8dv46pv125o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T05:41:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw8dv46pv125o/trad--ac8676f9bc2a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw8dv46pv125o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">宏福苑大火一周年前夕，港府官員稱「政府絕對容許」合法活動，但有遺屬表示悼念活動受壓，也有新聞工作者向BBC中文透露，相關周年報導在製作完成後突然「被抽起」。</summary></entry><entry><title>宏福苑大火一週年：「這條刺永遠都在」，遺屬在傷痛中尋找答案</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4r274lj82o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T03:21:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4r274lj82o/trad--907a7a594dc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4r274lj82o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">對許多家庭來說，道歉只是「最低消費」，他們仍在等一個完整的答案。BBC中文接觸了多位遇難者家屬，記錄他們怎樣度過這一年。</summary></entry><entry><title>小行星撞地球有解嗎？科學家揭示首次行星防禦實驗成果</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg238j0g47o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:18:22Z</updated><published>2026-11-27T06:16:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg238j0g47o/trad--dbb863918b2c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg238j0g47o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">四年前，一艘太空船蓄意撞向這顆小行星，使其表面形貌發生巨大變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普深圳會晤一週後再揮關稅大棒 對華稅率可達40%</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9ly484v6pdzo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T08:34:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9ly484v6pdzo/trad--fb116966281e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9ly484v6pdzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白宮稱，新關稅針對的是貿易夥伴的「結構性產能過剩」。經濟學家則警告，關稅由進口商品的美國企業支付，成本若轉嫁給消費者，可能推高物價並抑制全球貿易。</summary></entry><entry><title>BBC事實查核：與中國有關帳號用AI生成影攻擊台灣選舉候選人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmgvkp322xo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T11:53:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmgvkp322xo/trad--b840e2d70ae2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmgvkp322xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一波與中國有關的帳號用AI生成影片，攻擊台灣執政黨關鍵人物，包括總統賴清德和台北市長候選人沈伯洋。</summary></entry><entry><title>英國性調查：年輕人中五成女性、九成男性觀看色情片 三分之一未有性經驗</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmewv0vkgwplo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T09:11:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmewv0vkgwplo/trad--ad34bf61077e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmewv0vkgwplo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">目前，近四成女性（38%）與超過四分之一男性（28%）表示從未有過性行為；在1990、2000與2010年的調查中，這一比例約為 五分之一。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國法院裁定：中國科技巨頭華為，共謀竊取商業機密罪名成立</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq8lz8ddyg9o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T07:35:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq8lz8ddyg9o/trad--7a623113ad1c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq8lz8ddyg9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">華為在美被判10項罪成，包括竊取商業機密與銀行欺詐，但敲詐勒索組織罪無罪。</summary></entry><entry><title>陳吉寧：「清華系」失勢、「上海跳板」失靈與政治局委員落馬</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck7v27vn9659o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T14:54:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck7v27vn9659o/trad--83e451da2e3d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck7v27vn9659o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">陳吉寧落馬的時點尤其敏感：距離二十一大換屆不到一年，他本是外界觀察下屆常委佈局的關鍵人物，被查前僅僅六天仍在公開調研。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港宏福苑大火一週年：災後餘生，家在何方？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvg261dkxp7o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T23:49:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvg261dkxp7o/trad--319ba3ca1ae2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvg261dkxp7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港宏福苑大火一周年，BBC中文紀錄多位難屬如何走過災後一年。這場香港數十年以最致命災難奪去168條性命，1984戶失去家園，包括喪失丈夫與爸爸的Christy一家與父母雙亡的蘇先生。一年來，災民一邊重建新生活，一邊等待調查報告、申請法律援助，一邊向年幼孩子解釋死亡。調查結論公布後，官員辭職，數十人被捕或起訴。但對許多仍在傷痛中家庭來說，一切遠遠未及完結。</summary></entry><entry><title>上海市委書記陳吉寧被查 中共高層明日之星意外隕落</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83vgd1l5erlo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T11:14:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83vgd1l5erlo/trad--d2b2e6812ce5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83vgd1l5erlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國宣佈上海市委書記陳吉寧因「涉嫌嚴重違紀違法」，正接受當局的調查。這名此前仕途光明的官員原本有望進入政治局常委會，甚至可能成為總理接班人。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳回歸輝達 特朗普稱曾出手斡旋</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj5y1xdgv0x7o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T09:56:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj5y1xdgv0x7o/trad--64898396e705.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj5y1xdgv0x7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">輝達（Nvidia）共同創辦人黃仁勳辭職僅11天後突然重返公司，帶動輝達股價大幅反彈。董事會此前曾表明無意讓他復職。然而特朗普聲稱曾親自出面斡旋，促成黃仁勳本次回歸。這場復職風波也凸顯了科技巨頭與政治權力之間的複雜關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣「九合一」選舉：有哪些看點？藍綠勝負如何影響2028大選佈局？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T15:55:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad--d8ec69c28835.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">11月28日，台灣將舉行「九合一」地方選舉。BBC中文走訪台北、新北與高雄三大關鍵戰場，解析藍綠激戰、中間選民崛起，以及中國因素對選情的影響。這場選舉不只關乎地方治理，也可能為2028年總統大選定下基調。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄「三巨頭」會晤的台前幕後</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T16:16:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad--4b4d8f07ee39.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC記者從深圳帶你回顧這場中美俄「三巨頭」峰會的台前幕後。</summary></entry><entry><title>APEC上與習近平、特朗普歷史性會晤，對普京是一場重大勝利</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T03:46:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad--12120a5a45a8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">週四美國、中國和俄羅斯領導人的會晤將為普京（普丁）提供一個重要的舞台——但這並不會讓他離贏得烏克蘭戰爭更近一步。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄「三巨頭」坐在了一起，世界正滑向大國共管嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T00:11:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad--34ff6da99463.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「他們能坐下來，就說明這個世界還沒有到第一次或第二次世界大戰那個狀況。」香港科技大學榮休教授丁學良對BBC說。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美能源大戰如何影響你的帳單？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T01:45:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad--bf8b484b78f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中美之間的博弈可能會對能源成本產生重大影響，但誰會最終獲勝？</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳曾告訴我，那些關於中國與國家安全的問題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T02:41:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad--d34e970c53e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳正因涉嫌與一名中國間諜出軌而接受調查，他對世界秩序的未來遠比其他科技巨頭老闆重要得多。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>Anthropic公司或許已解決重大數學難題：黎曼猜想</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:10:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad--5f715a8024f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Anthropic公司或許已解決重大數學難題：黎曼猜想</summary></entry><entry><title>說唱歌手出身尼泊爾新總理首訪印度：如何平衡對華關係</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:09:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad--6ddb573c32e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">說唱歌手出身的尼泊爾新總理沙哈首訪印度，盼重啟關係並爭取山洪重建援助，但邊界爭議與經驗不足成考驗</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄元首峰會：從烏克蘭、伊朗、和平宣言到承諾核對話</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T12:22:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad--998083d65242.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">會後發表的中俄美元首和平宣言顯示，三國領導人承諾就「減少核風險、防止核擴散」展開對話，並就聯合國改革、能源穩定和國際刑事法院管轄權等議題達成四點共識。</summary></entry><entry><title>高雄選戰「知識藍」對決「新潮流」，國民黨能複製「韓流」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T16:25:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad--a43863954373.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">柯志恩以「知識藍」的姿態拉攏中間選民，支持度大幅追貼深耕高雄20年的賴瑞隆，選情咬緊。</summary></entry><entry><title>「台灣乾爹」光環崩塌：黃仁勳事件如何震動產業、政治與社會？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T09:51:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad--d4f113586173.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳光速跌落神壇的事件，讓台灣社會對他的崇拜、政治對他的政績綁定，以及產業對他個人的依賴重新校準。</summary></entry><entry><title>從倉頡換成漢語拼音：電腦輸入法會影響下一代學習中文嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T06:12:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad--737603724a9b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港教育局提出小學二年級學生應該初步掌握以「漢語拼音輸入法」在電腦上輸入中文。打字方式的改變，會如何影響下一代學習語言？</summary></entry><entry><title>里長赴中旅遊受關注：為何北京鎖定里長？里長怎麼看？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T09:03:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad--590a4fb67825.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣地方選舉即將到來，近年北京對台統戰工作重心從政商菁英轉向基層社會，而里長作為選舉期間的地方「樁腳」，就成為了北京的重要接觸對象。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國人如何背棄特朗普——2026中期大選結果覆盤</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f#6</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T00:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f--393d86e5dbaa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">九張圖表解釋民主黨在美國中期選舉中的壓倒性勝利，以及這對總統意味著甚麼。</summary></entry><entry><title>九合一前夕：台灣幾乎年年選舉，會引起「投票疲勞」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T10:39:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad--7bd3a1bacef6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣在過去七年間，幾乎每年都有大型選舉、罷免或公投。有學者形容台灣政治人物常處於「選舉模式」，在面對不同議題時往往急於回應。</summary></entry><entry><title>從蔡康永、《VIVANT》到姆巴佩，北京為何區別處理「辱華」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T00:21:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad--c99d6f3ad72f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">最近幾週，中國輿論場接連出現多宗被貼上「辱華」標籤的爭議事件：台灣藝人蔡康永、日本電視劇《VIVANT》以及法國球星姆巴佩。三宗事件看似性質相近，但官方反應與輿論熱度卻明顯不同，多位分析人士對BBC中文指出：這些差異背後是當局對於每個事件的定性並不相同。</summary></entry><entry><title>我們如何知道疫苗安全？它們是如何經過測試？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qj5772kl0go/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T00:27:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qj5772kl0go/trad--4d4ebe5a2954.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qj5772kl0go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從實驗室試驗到終身的安全監測，疫苗在提供給民眾前後，都會經過多重檢驗。</summary></entry><entry><title>你的孩子會說謊嗎？這或許並非壞事</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:10:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad--2be70a328ee8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">父母可能會因為孩子撒謊而生氣，但專家解釋說，這是孩子人格成長的過程</summary></entry><entry><title>羅伯·派汀森：《暮光之城》男主角如何成為007</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T02:38:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad--03fa8a167e7c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">羅伯·派汀森（Robert Pattinson）早已在《暮光之城》系列、《蝙蝠俠》和《奧德賽》等電影，奠定了自己作為男主角、動作明星及演員的地位。如今，他接下詹姆士·龐德（James Bond；占士邦）一角，將使他的知名度更上一層樓。</summary></entry><entry><title>身體最常受傷、卻很少人會刻意鍛鍊的部位：腳踝</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T00:29:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad--c5f5a8d6cf18.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">運動物理治療師珍妮薇芙·陶亞（Genevieve Tawiah）分享了她護理關節的秘訣；關節問題佔急診就診量的 5%。</summary></entry><entry><title>「你甚至不會告訴密友」：分娩後遺症，為何多年後仍揮之不去？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-27T18:17:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T08:33:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad--b1eb3b049467.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從失禁到長期疼痛，數以百萬計的女性在分娩數十年後仍然飽受後遺症困擾。</summary></entry></feed>
